{"id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-capture-axiom.md","title":"真理捕获规则及其作用域","display":"df-capture-axiom — 真理捕获规则及其作用域","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-capture-axiom","aliases":["91-df-capture-axiom","91-df-capture"],"display":"df-capture-axiom — 真理捕获规则及其作用域","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-capture-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-capture-axiom</span><span>91-df-capture</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-capture-axiom — 真理捕获规则及其作用域"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是指定的规则实例域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 与句子编码固定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是一个形式系统；规则只作用于没有未解除假设的定理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}capture\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\varphi}{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}capture\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\varphi}{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\mathcal D}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,[S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\mathcal D}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,[S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书记该规则 nec。FS 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；不能将基础句范围的规则直接应用于说谎者。\n这不同于对象公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。在未解除的假设下应用规则会错误地通过演绎定理产生更强原理。</p>\n<p>来源：第 12–14 章，尤其 Definition 14.4，印刷页 147，PDF 页 158。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}capture\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\frac{\\varphi}{T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})}\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cap}_{\\mathcal D}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal D\\,[S\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1333,"backlinks":[{"id":"387103572d3822c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Cap}_D(S),\\operatorname{Rel}_D(S)$ 为 [[91-df-capture-axiom]]、[[91-df-release-axiom]] 的无假设定理闭包性质。"},{"id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{cap}}$、$\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{rel}}$ 为 [[91-df-capture-axiom]]、[[91-df-release-axiom]] 的无假设定理规则。"},{"id":"8556c1ac7447fbfa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-capture-axiom]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressi